_model: other_work
---
title: Other works
---
body:

Beyond Euclid's *Elements*, Dr. Joyce produced several smaller
tutorials and demos using the same Geometry Applet. This edition
republishes them, rendering their diagrams with
[geomlib](/geomlib/).

- [**Compass Geometry**](/other-works/compass-geometry/) — a
  seven-part introduction to Euclidean constructions using compass
  and straightedge.
- **Spherical and inversive geometry tutorials**:
    - [Round triangles](/other-works/round-triangles/)
    - [Configuration of six circles and eight points](/other-works/six-circles-eight-points/)
    - [Desargues' Theorem](/other-works/desargues-theorem/)
- [**The Euler Line**](/other-works/euler-line/) — a single-page
  interactive demo of the Euler line of a triangle.
